{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 22,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Death of Eli"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the word of Samuel came to all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, Tg.; LXX, Vg. add And it came to pass in those days that the Philistines gathered themselves together to fight; LXX adds further against Israel"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Israel."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Israel went out to battle against the Philistines, and encamped beside Ebenezer; and the Philistines encamped in Aphek. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Ark of God Captured"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Philistines put themselves in battle array against Israel. And when they joined battle, Israel was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. struck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "defeated by the Philistines, who killed about four thousand men of the army in the field. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the people had come into the camp, the elders of Israel said, “Why has the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " defeated us today before the Philistines? Let us bring the ark of the covenant of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from Shiloh to us, that when it comes among us it may save us from the hand of our enemies.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the people sent to Shiloh, that they might bring from there the ark of the covenant of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts, who dwells "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "between"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the cherubim. And the two sons of Eli, Hophni and Phinehas, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " there with the ark of the covenant of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the ark of the covenant of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came into the camp, all Israel shouted so loudly that the earth shook. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when the Philistines heard the noise of the shout, they said, “What "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "does"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sound of this great shout in the camp of the Hebrews "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mean?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” Then they understood that the ark of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " had come into the camp. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the Philistines were afraid, for they said, “God has come into the camp!” And they said, “Woe to us! For such a thing has never happened before. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Woe to us! Who will deliver us from the hand of these mighty gods? These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the gods who struck the Egyptians with all the plagues in the wilderness. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Be strong and conduct yourselves like men, you Philistines, that you do not become servants of the Hebrews, as they have been to you. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Be men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Conduct yourselves like men, and fight!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the Philistines fought, and Israel was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. struck down"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "defeated, and every man fled to his tent. There was a very great slaughter, and there fell of Israel thirty thousand foot soldiers. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also the ark of God was captured; and the two sons of Eli, Hophni and Phinehas, died."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Death of Eli"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then a man of Benjamin ran from the battle line the same day, and came to Shiloh with his clothes torn and dirt on his head. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when he came, there was Eli, sitting on a seat "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, Vg.; LXX beside the gate watching the road"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by the wayside watching, for his heart "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "trembled with anxiety"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "trembled for the ark of God. And when the man came into the city and told "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all the city cried out. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Eli heard the noise of the outcry, he said, “What "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "does"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sound of this tumult "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mean?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” And the man came quickly and told Eli. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Eli was ninety-eight years old, and his eyes were so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "fixed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "dim that he could not see."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the man said to Eli, “I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " he who came from the battle. And I fled today from the battle line.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said, “What happened, my son?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the messenger answered and said, “Israel has fled before the Philistines, and there has been a great slaughter among the people. Also your two sons, Hophni and Phinehas, are dead; and the ark of God has been captured.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then it happened, when he made mention of the ark of God, that Eli fell off the seat backward by the side of the gate; and his neck was broken and he died, for the man was old and heavy. And he had judged Israel forty years."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ichabod"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now his daughter-in-law, Phinehas’ wife, was with child, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "due"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to be delivered; and when she heard the news that the ark of God was captured, and that her father-in-law and her husband were dead, she bowed herself and gave birth, for her labor pains came upon her. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And about the time of her death the women who stood by her said to her, “Do not fear, for you have borne a son.” But she did not answer, nor did she "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "pay any attention to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "regard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then she named the child Ichabod,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Inglorious"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " saying, “The glory has departed from Israel!” because the ark of God had been captured and because of her father-in-law and her husband. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And she said, “The glory has departed from Israel, for the ark of God has been captured.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}